Built programs
The prebuilt programs in docs/get/, chatcomputer/brain/bin/, os/release/ and docs/demo/engine/
are built from this repository's code together with open-source components under their own
licences: the Rust standard library (MIT or Apache-2.0); in the Windows and Mac apps, Tauri and the
other crates listed in apps/desktop/src-tauri/Cargo.lock (mostly MIT or Apache-2.0), and NSIS in
the Windows installer (zlib licence).

The AI models Chat Computer runs (for example Qwen's, under the Apache License 2.0) are downloaded
when needed and are not part of this repository.
